G="Mystery of Faith; Lord, I am not worthy"
E=[(G,233,'Heaven opens. The Lamb who was slain is *here*.','Heaven opens. The Lamb who was slain is *here*. At the priest\'s words, "The mystery of faith," the people may answer in one of the acclamations the Church gives them: *"Save us, Savior of the world, for by your Cross and Resurrection you have set us free."*'),
(G,239,'**"Lord, I am not worthy that you should enter under my roof…"**','**"Lord, I am not worthy that you should enter under my roof, but only say the word and my soul shall be healed."**')]
